OL,3,ALondon Fashion Week 2026: The five
OL,4,Atrends we'll see in spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis London Fashion Week has been about
OL,7,Freturn and renewal - as two of
OL,8,FBritain's biggest designers showcased
OL,9,Ftheir spring/summer 2027 designs.
OL,11,FThe first was Alexander McQueen, which
OL,12,Fas a brand moved to London after 25
OL,13,Fyears of showing in Paris - something
OL,14,FLaura Weir, CEO of the British Fashion
OL,15,FCouncil, told the BBC was "quite a big
OL,16,Fdeal for us".
OL,18,FCreative director Sean McGirr brought
OL,19,Fthe brand back to its roots, with a
OL,20,Frunway of devil horns, lace corsets and
OL,21,Fchainmail skull dresses.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
