OL,3,ALondon Fashion Week 2026: The five
OL,4,Atrends we'll see in spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FMulberry was the second designer to
OL,7,Fmake its big return, this time after a
OL,8,Fnine-year absence, with Christopher
OL,9,FKane's debut collection centring around
OL,10,Fthe brand's Baywater bag, while going
OL,11,Fbig on leather in the form of coats,
OL,12,Fskirts and loafers.
